  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Opt 305.01 Licensing for Active Duty Military and Military Spouses. Active duty military and military spouses shall apply for facilitated licensing in accordance with Plc 304.02.\n\nSource. #12383, eff 9-16-17 ss by #14242, eff 6-21-25, EXPIRES: 6-21-35",
